3.1.m:
Thus has this dissolution of the elements been declared to you by me.
This withdrawal through washing away has Brahmā as its cause;
it has been declared in brief. What more shall I describe to you?

3.2.m:
Devoted, endowed with faith, free from arrogance, who act accordingly,
abiding by the Vedic and traditional duties of the classes and stages of life;
their offices have ceased until the end of the manvantara.
